# Phase 131: FOLLOW on a satellite on the sky map. A name with no pass
# is refused with a reason; the satellite arm-pass picked has its pass
# flown, the same way TRACK SELECTED PASS flies it. arm-pass moves the
# satellite clock so that pass opens in 45 s.
name    Map satellite FOLLOW: refusal, then a pass flown
timeout 420

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Map satellite
wait   5
press  GOTO:PASSES
wait   5
press  MAP:FOLLOW SAT NO SUCH SATELLITE
expect 30  has no pass worth tracking
arm-pass 45
expect 5   [SCENARIO] armed
press  MAP:FOLLOW ARMED SAT
expect 5   [SATMAP] Following
expect 10  its pass in
expect 10  Satellite: slewing
expect 150 on target, recording.
absent 1   captures\Jupiter_
shot   map-follow
press  GOTO:STOP TRACKING
wait   5
